  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Your logged-in state depends on the vrchat domain in question; as such, if you're logged in with vrchat.com, but an instance link uses www.vrchat.com, the invite me button isn't shown. This is particularly hard to diagnose because Google Chrome does not display the www. part of the URL in the URL bar.\nRepro:\n1. Clear cookies, then log in at https://vrchat.com/home\n2. Open https://www.vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_fe5d4695-ebc7-4087-848a-c101897cf43f&instanceId=3219 - the invite me button does not appear",
